3
00:00:18,343 --> 00:00:21,343
Scene 1: Movie Chat

4
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:25,550
I've watched a lot of movies lately.

5
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:27,552
Nice!

6
00:00:27,576 --> 00:00:30,543
What kind of movies did you watch?

7
00:00:30,566 --> 00:00:36,299
I watched action, horror, and animated movies.

8
00:00:36,322 --> 00:00:39,089
Wow, you watched a lot!

9
00:00:39,112 --> 00:00:42,358
How was the action movie?

10
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:45,192
It was really fun!

11
00:00:45,216 --> 00:00:48,983
The lead actor was so cool.

12
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:51,661
Was it an exciting movie?

13
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:55,327
Yeah, it was super exciting!

14
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,629
There were so many car chases.

15
00:00:58,653 --> 00:01:01,586
That sounds awesome!

16
00:01:01,609 --> 00:01:04,448
How was the horror movie?

17
00:01:04,471 --> 00:01:08,366
The horror movie was really scary.

18
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:10,957
Was it fun, though?

19
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:15,386
No, not really.

20
00:01:15,409 --> 00:01:17,303
Why not?

21
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:22,994
There were too many dark scenes, so I couldn’t see much.

22
00:01:23,017 --> 00:01:25,017
I see.

23
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:28,240
Scary movies can be tough, huh?

24
00:01:28,263 --> 00:01:34,096
Yeah, I couldn’t sleep at all last night.

25
00:01:34,119 --> 00:01:37,586
That must’ve been rough.

26
00:01:37,609 --> 00:01:40,375
How was the animated movie?

27
00:01:40,398 --> 00:01:44,332
The animated movie was so much fun!

28
00:01:44,355 --> 00:01:46,526
What was the story about?

29
00:01:46,549 --> 00:01:50,116
There were lots of cute animals in it.

30
00:01:50,139 --> 00:01:52,872
The music was great too.

31
00:01:52,895 --> 00:01:55,229
Were the visuals nice?

32
00:01:55,253 --> 00:01:59,053
Yeah, the animation was really beautiful.

33
00:01:59,076 --> 00:02:01,209
It was so touching.

34
00:02:01,232 --> 00:02:05,766
Out of the three movies, which one did you like the most?

35
00:02:05,789 --> 00:02:09,284
I liked the animated movie the best.

36
00:02:09,307 --> 00:02:11,674
I want to watch it again.

37
00:02:11,697 --> 00:02:15,501
I like action movies.

38
00:02:15,525 --> 00:02:17,939
Want to watch one together next time?

39
00:02:17,962 --> 00:02:19,729
Nice!

40
00:02:19,752 --> 00:02:22,085
Let’s go together!

41
00:02:22,108 --> 00:02:25,242
How about next Saturday?

42
00:02:25,266 --> 00:02:28,302
Saturday works for me.

43
00:02:28,326 --> 00:02:30,659
What time should we go?

44
00:02:30,682 --> 00:02:33,286
How about 2 PM?

45
00:02:33,309 --> 00:02:35,161
Nice!

46
00:02:35,184 --> 00:02:38,761
Should we go to the theater near the station?

47
00:02:38,785 --> 00:02:43,318
Yeah, it’s new and big.

48
00:02:43,341 --> 00:02:45,078
Got it.

49
00:02:45,102 --> 00:02:47,754
How much are the tickets?

50
00:02:47,777 --> 00:02:50,377
2,000 yen.

51
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,800
I’ll buy them!

52
00:02:52,823 --> 00:02:54,633
Thanks so much!

53
00:02:54,656 --> 00:02:56,701
I'm so happy!

54
00:02:56,725 --> 00:02:59,725
No, you're welcome!

55
00:02:59,748 --> 00:03:01,751
I can't wait!

56
00:03:01,775 --> 00:03:06,627
Yes, I love action movies too!

57
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:09,017
Let's grab some popcorn too.

58
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,894
Nice!

59
00:03:10,917 --> 00:03:14,684
I love sweet popcorn.

60
00:03:14,707 --> 00:03:19,840
I prefer salty popcorn, so let's get both!

61
00:03:19,863 --> 00:03:21,903
Sounds like a plan!

62
00:03:21,927 --> 00:03:24,816
I'm getting hungry just thinking about it.

63
00:03:24,839 --> 00:03:28,053
Alright, see you on Saturday!

64
00:03:28,076 --> 00:03:31,310
Yes, I'm really looking forward to it!

65
00:03:31,333 --> 00:03:34,338
See you on Saturday, then!

66
00:03:34,361 --> 00:03:41,466
You can find the link to review today's video in the description and top comment. *Note: The site may be removed without prior notice.

67
00:03:41,466 --> 00:03:44,466
Scene 2: A Food Adventure with Friends

68
00:03:44,466 --> 00:03:50,202
I went to a restaurant with friends yesterday.

69
00:03:50,225 --> 00:03:52,116
Nice!

70
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:55,140
What did you eat?

71
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:58,702
We tried all sorts of dishes.

72
00:03:58,725 --> 00:04:02,392
I had curry and cake.

73
00:04:02,415 --> 00:04:05,748
Curry and cake?

74
00:04:05,771 --> 00:04:09,371
That's an unusual combo!

75
00:04:09,394 --> 00:04:11,127
Yeah.

76
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:15,221
The curry was really spicy.

77
00:04:15,245 --> 00:04:18,411
Do you like spicy food?

78
00:04:18,434 --> 00:04:20,268
Yeah.

79
00:04:20,291 --> 00:04:24,424
It was spicy, but so good!

80
00:04:24,447 --> 00:04:27,090
That's great!

81
00:04:27,114 --> 00:04:30,084
How was the cake?

82
00:04:30,107 --> 00:04:34,074
The cake was super sweet.

83
00:04:34,097 --> 00:04:36,669
Was it strawberry cake?

84
00:04:36,692 --> 00:04:38,567
Yeah.

85
00:04:38,591 --> 00:04:42,363
It had lots of strawberries.

86
00:04:42,386 --> 00:04:44,827
It looked adorable.

87
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:47,916
Sweet things are the best, aren't they?

88
00:04:47,939 --> 00:04:51,013
Did you eat anything else?

89
00:04:51,037 --> 00:04:55,313
We drank lemon juice.

90
00:04:55,336 --> 00:04:58,336
Wasn't the juice too sour?

91
00:04:58,359 --> 00:05:01,617
It was really sour!

92
00:05:01,641 --> 00:05:05,774
But it was refreshing.

93
00:05:05,797 --> 00:05:10,564
Sour things are good for you, after all.

94
00:05:10,587 --> 00:05:12,220
Yeah.

95
00:05:12,243 --> 00:05:17,012
Finally, we had some green tea.

96
00:05:17,035 --> 00:05:19,835
How was the green tea?

97
00:05:19,858 --> 00:05:23,825
The green tea was a little bitter.

98
00:05:23,848 --> 00:05:26,981
Do you dislike bitter tea?

99
00:05:27,004 --> 00:05:34,338
No, it was perfect after the sweet cake.

100
00:05:34,361 --> 00:05:35,894
I see.

101
00:05:35,917 --> 00:05:38,406
That's a sophisticated taste.

102
00:05:38,429 --> 00:05:40,363
Yeah.

103
00:05:40,386 --> 00:05:43,152
It was really delicious tea.

104
00:05:43,175 --> 00:05:46,942
Do you want to go back to that restaurant?

105
00:05:46,965 --> 00:05:48,698
Yeah.

106
00:05:48,721 --> 00:05:52,255
I'm planning to go again next week.

107
00:05:52,278 --> 00:05:55,211
What are you going to eat next time?

108
00:05:55,234 --> 00:06:00,410
Next time, I want to try the fish dish and curry.

109
00:06:00,434 --> 00:06:03,601
Is the fish dish famous too?

110
00:06:03,624 --> 00:06:08,302
My friend said it was really delicious.

111
00:06:08,325 --> 00:06:12,408
I want to go to that restaurant too.

112
00:06:12,432 --> 00:06:15,065
What day works best for you?

113
00:06:15,088 --> 00:06:24,770
If you caught that, leave a comment!

114
00:06:24,770 --> 00:06:27,770
Scene 3: Travel Memories

115
00:06:27,770 --> 00:06:32,979
We had a long break last week, didn’t we?

116
00:06:33,002 --> 00:06:36,242
Did you go anywhere?

117
00:06:36,266 --> 00:06:37,999
Yeah.

118
00:06:38,022 --> 00:06:43,959
I went to Tokyo, Kyoto, and Okinawa.

119
00:06:43,983 --> 00:06:46,160
Wow, that’s amazing!

120
00:06:46,184 --> 00:06:50,318
You visited so many places!

121
00:06:50,342 --> 00:06:52,075
Yeah.

122
00:06:52,098 --> 00:06:55,431
It was a pretty packed trip.

123
00:06:55,454 --> 00:06:58,393
How was Tokyo?

124
00:06:58,417 --> 00:07:03,384
Tokyo was so lively!

125
00:07:03,408 --> 00:07:06,408
There were so many people.

126
00:07:06,431 --> 00:07:09,997
Was the transportation convenient?

127
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,954
Yeah.

128
00:07:11,977 --> 00:07:17,350
The trains came right away, so it was super convenient.

129
00:07:17,374 --> 00:07:20,386
How was Kyoto?

130
00:07:20,409 --> 00:07:25,850
Kyoto was such a quiet and historic city.

131
00:07:25,873 --> 00:07:28,886
Were the temples beautiful?

132
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:30,583
Yeah.

133
00:07:30,606 --> 00:07:34,006
The temples were absolutely stunning.

134
00:07:34,029 --> 00:07:37,514
There was so much greenery too.

135
00:07:37,537 --> 00:07:39,711
That sounds wonderful!

136
00:07:39,735 --> 00:07:42,701
How was Okinawa?

137
00:07:42,724 --> 00:07:47,058
Okinawa was really hot.

138
00:07:47,081 --> 00:07:50,314
The weather was great, though.

139
00:07:50,337 --> 00:07:53,153
Did you see the ocean?

140
00:07:53,176 --> 00:07:54,820
Yeah.

141
00:07:54,844 --> 00:07:59,299
The ocean was so vast and blue.

142
00:07:59,322 --> 00:08:02,803
Did you go swimming?

143
00:08:02,826 --> 00:08:06,264
No, I didn’t swim.

144
00:08:06,288 --> 00:08:10,488
But I took a walk nearby.

145
00:08:10,511 --> 00:08:15,790
Out of the three places, which did you like the most?

146
00:08:15,813 --> 00:08:20,258
I loved Kyoto the most.

147
00:08:20,281 --> 00:08:23,695
I prefer quiet places.

148
00:08:23,719 --> 00:08:26,799
Was Okinawa far?

149
00:08:26,822 --> 00:08:33,311
It took two hours by plane, so it was a little far.

150
00:08:33,334 --> 00:08:35,167
I see.

151
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:38,793
It’s great that there was so much nature.

152
00:08:38,817 --> 00:08:40,417
Yeah.

153
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:43,507
It was such a wonderful experience.

154
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:48,263
I’m planning to travel next month.

155
00:08:48,286 --> 00:08:50,953
Where are you thinking of going?

156
00:08:50,976 --> 00:08:54,376
I’m thinking of going to Kyoto.

157
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:57,932
I want to see the historic buildings.

158
00:08:57,955 --> 00:09:01,388
Kyoto is a fantastic choice!

159
00:09:01,411 --> 00:09:04,478
There are also so many delicious treats.

160
00:09:04,501 --> 00:09:07,359
What should I try?

161
00:09:07,382 --> 00:09:11,263
The matcha ice cream is amazing!

162
00:09:11,287 --> 00:09:13,496
You’ve got to try it!

163
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,519
Got it!

164
00:09:15,542 --> 00:09:18,142
I’ll definitely eat it!

165
00:09:18,165 --> 00:09:21,165
Have you decided on a hotel yet?

166
00:09:21,188 --> 00:09:24,722
No, I haven’t decided yet.

167
00:09:24,745 --> 00:09:27,311
What kind of place would you recommend?

168
00:09:27,334 --> 00:09:31,701
A hotel near the station would be convenient.

169
00:09:31,724 --> 00:09:33,769
It makes getting around so much easier.

170
00:09:33,793 --> 00:09:35,326
That’s true.

171
00:09:35,349 --> 00:09:38,682
I’ll look it up online.

172
00:09:38,705 --> 00:09:42,072
Hope you find a great hotel!

173
00:09:42,095 --> 00:09:43,534
Yeah.

174
00:09:43,557 --> 00:09:47,559
I’d love a quiet and beautiful hotel.

175
00:09:47,583 --> 00:09:52,183
Kyoto’s nights are stunning—enjoy your time there!

176
00:09:52,206 --> 00:09:53,739
Thanks so much!

177
00:09:53,762 --> 00:09:56,696
I’ll take lots of photos.

178
00:09:56,719 --> 00:10:00,519
I’m really looking forward to the souvenirs!

179
00:10:00,542 --> 00:10:01,989
Yeah.

180
00:10:02,012 --> 00:10:04,945
I’ll bring back some delicious snacks.

181
00:10:04,968 --> 00:10:08,208
Take care and have a safe trip!

182
00:10:08,232 --> 00:10:11,232
Scene 4: School Life and Teachers

183
00:10:11,232 --> 00:10:15,598
How’s life at your new school?

184
00:10:15,621 --> 00:10:18,788
It’s so much fun!

185
00:10:18,811 --> 00:10:22,744
I meet new people every day.

186
00:10:22,767 --> 00:10:24,837
That’s great to hear!

187
00:10:24,861 --> 00:10:28,904
What’s your Japanese teacher like?

188
00:10:28,928 --> 00:10:33,661
She’s a little strict.

189
00:10:33,684 --> 00:10:39,298
She always looks serious when she enters the classroom.

190
00:10:39,321 --> 00:10:42,255
Is she good at teaching?

191
00:10:42,278 --> 00:10:43,811
Yeah.

192
00:10:43,834 --> 00:10:49,801
Her teaching methods are excellent—I understand everything so well.

193
00:10:49,824 --> 00:10:52,519
That’s reassuring!

194
00:10:52,542 --> 00:10:56,075
How about your senior at your part-time job?

195
00:10:56,098 --> 00:11:00,465
They’re really kind.

196
00:11:00,488 --> 00:11:02,821
Are they funny?

197
00:11:02,844 --> 00:11:04,494
Yeah.

198
00:11:04,518 --> 00:11:08,284
They always tell hilarious stories.

199
00:11:08,307 --> 00:11:10,774
We laugh a lot together.

200
00:11:10,797 --> 00:11:14,764
Do they help you when you’re in trouble?

201
00:11:14,787 --> 00:11:16,353
Yeah.

202
00:11:16,376 --> 00:11:22,027
They always lend a hand so kindly—I’m so grateful.

203
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:24,460
What a great senior to have!

204
00:11:24,484 --> 00:11:27,734
How are your classmates?

205
00:11:27,758 --> 00:11:32,398
Everyone is so energetic!

206
00:11:32,421 --> 00:11:35,621
And really friendly too.

207
00:11:35,644 --> 00:11:38,244
Is your class lively?

208
00:11:38,268 --> 00:11:39,956
Yeah.

209
00:11:39,979 --> 00:11:44,379
The breaks are always so noisy and fun!

210
00:11:44,402 --> 00:11:47,202
Every day is a blast.

211
00:11:47,225 --> 00:11:51,924
You’re surrounded by amazing people!

212
00:11:51,947 --> 00:11:56,125
I think I’m really lucky.

213
00:11:56,149 --> 00:12:00,635
Have you gone anywhere with your friends yet?

214
00:12:00,659 --> 00:12:06,192
Last Saturday, we all went to the park together.

215
00:12:06,215 --> 00:12:09,215
What did you do at the park?

216
00:12:09,238 --> 00:12:13,815
We played soccer and took photos.

217
00:12:13,838 --> 00:12:16,205
That sounds like fun!

218
00:12:16,228 --> 00:12:19,286
Did you have a bento?

219
00:12:19,310 --> 00:12:20,843
Yeah.

220
00:12:20,866 --> 00:12:26,345
One of my friends made delicious sandwiches for us.

221
00:12:26,369 --> 00:12:29,446
Your friend is a great cook!

222
00:12:29,469 --> 00:12:31,280
Yeah.

223
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:34,183
They were so tasty!

224
00:12:34,207 --> 00:12:38,087
I brought some fruit.

225
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:40,566
What kind of fruit?

226
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:44,072
I brought apples and bananas.

227
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:46,662
We all ate them together.

228
00:12:46,685 --> 00:12:49,852
It was a wonderful weekend, wasn’t it?

229
00:12:49,875 --> 00:12:51,445
Yeah.

230
00:12:51,468 --> 00:12:55,881
Next time, I’d love to invite our teacher too.

231
00:12:55,905 --> 00:12:59,471
I’m sure they’d be happy to join!

232
00:12:59,494 --> 00:13:02,028
Please do ask them!

233
00:13:02,051 --> 00:13:06,386
But they might be too busy.

234
00:13:06,409 --> 00:13:09,576
You won’t know unless you ask!

235
00:13:09,599 --> 00:13:11,599
That’s true.

236
00:13:11,622 --> 00:13:15,189
I’ll ask them at school tomorrow.

237
00:13:15,212 --> 00:13:18,145
Why not invite your senior too?

238
00:13:18,168 --> 00:13:20,175
Nice!

239
00:13:20,198 --> 00:13:24,232
They mentioned they love sports.

240
00:13:24,255 --> 00:13:29,502
The more people, the livelier it gets!

241
00:13:29,526 --> 00:13:31,015
Yeah.

242
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:34,441
This could turn into a big event!

243
00:13:34,464 --> 00:13:37,343
Planning it is going to be so much fun!

244
00:13:37,367 --> 00:13:39,211
Yeah.

245
00:13:39,235 --> 00:13:42,968
I’ll brainstorm a schedule tonight.

246
00:13:42,991 --> 00:13:45,569
Good luck with that!

247
00:13:45,593 --> 00:13:47,793
I’m rooting for you!

248
00:13:47,816 --> 00:13:49,583
Thanks so much!

249
00:13:49,606 --> 00:13:52,178
I’ll come up with a great plan!

250
00:13:52,201 --> 00:13:55,201
Scene 5: How to Enjoy Anime / Exploring Different Anime Genres

251
00:13:55,201 --> 00:14:00,451
Have you been watching any anime lately?

252
00:14:00,475 --> 00:14:01,490
Yeah.

253
00:14:01,513 --> 00:14:05,247
I’ve been watching three different ones.

254
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,876
That’s quite a few!

255
00:14:07,899 --> 00:14:10,232
What kind of anime are they?

256
00:14:10,255 --> 00:14:16,622
A battle anime, a sports anime, and a slice-of-life anime.

257
00:14:16,645 --> 00:14:19,811
What do you think of the battle anime?

258
00:14:19,834 --> 00:14:22,768
It’s so cool!

259
00:14:22,791 --> 00:14:25,724
It’s famous worldwide.

260
00:14:25,747 --> 00:14:28,380
Is it an action-packed anime?

261
00:14:28,403 --> 00:14:29,970
Yeah.

262
00:14:29,993 --> 00:14:34,873
The music is loud, and it’s really exciting!

263
00:14:34,897 --> 00:14:37,763
How about the sports anime?

264
00:14:37,786 --> 00:14:42,397
The sports anime is incredibly intense.

265
00:14:42,421 --> 00:14:44,388
It really pumps me up!

266
00:14:44,411 --> 00:14:46,492
Is it fun to watch?

267
00:14:46,516 --> 00:14:48,249
Yeah.

268
00:14:48,272 --> 00:14:50,639
It’s super fun!

269
00:14:50,662 --> 00:14:53,951
I look forward to it every week.

270
00:14:53,974 --> 00:14:57,153
What about the slice-of-life anime?

271
00:14:57,177 --> 00:15:01,777
The slice-of-life anime is really cute.

272
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,167
Is it a calm story?

273
00:15:04,190 --> 00:15:05,756
Yeah.

274
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:09,752
It’s quiet and relaxing.

275
00:15:09,775 --> 00:15:12,175
It really soothes my mind.

276
00:15:12,198 --> 00:15:17,565
Out of the three, which one do you like the most?

277
00:15:17,588 --> 00:15:22,755
I like the sports anime the best.

278
00:15:22,778 --> 00:15:24,778
It’s so moving.

279
00:15:24,801 --> 00:15:27,567
Do you read manga too?

280
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,157
Yeah.

281
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:32,659
I’m reading the manga for the battle anime.

282
00:15:32,683 --> 00:15:35,326
Is the manga interesting too?

283
00:15:35,349 --> 00:15:36,949
Yeah.

284
00:15:36,972 --> 00:15:40,642
The artwork in the manga is stunning.

285
00:15:40,665 --> 00:15:43,603
Did you buy it at a bookstore?

286
00:15:43,627 --> 00:15:47,714
No, I’m reading it on my smartphone.

287
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:49,777
It’s so convenient!

288
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:54,734
Modern smartphones sure have big screens, don’t they?

289
00:15:54,757 --> 00:15:56,123
Yeah.

290
00:15:56,146 --> 00:15:59,213
You can read anywhere with them.

291
00:15:59,236 --> 00:16:00,648
I love that.

292
00:16:00,671 --> 00:16:04,005
I don’t watch much anime, actually.

293
00:16:04,028 --> 00:16:07,228
Got any recommendations?

294
00:16:07,251 --> 00:16:11,685
In that case, you’d enjoy slice-of-life anime.

295
00:16:11,708 --> 00:16:14,341
They’re short and easy to watch.

296
00:16:14,364 --> 00:16:16,731
What’s the title?

297
00:16:16,754 --> 00:16:20,631
It’s called *Nonbiri Seikatsu*.

298
00:16:20,654 --> 00:16:24,192
*Nonbiri Seikatsu*, huh?

299
00:16:24,216 --> 00:16:26,467
I’ll keep that in mind.

300
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:29,764
Do you have time tonight?

301
00:16:29,788 --> 00:16:31,193
Yeah.

302
00:16:31,216 --> 00:16:33,425
I’m free in the evening.

303
00:16:33,449 --> 00:16:36,307
I don’t have any plans.

304
00:16:36,331 --> 00:16:40,064
Then give the first episode a try!

305
00:16:40,087 --> 00:16:42,946
You can watch it online.

306
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:44,837
Got it!

307
00:16:44,859 --> 00:16:47,059
I’ll check it out.

308
00:16:47,082 --> 00:16:50,050
Let me know what you think!

309
00:16:50,074 --> 00:16:51,316
Yeah.

310
00:16:51,339 --> 00:16:54,339
We can talk about it at school tomorrow.

311
00:16:54,362 --> 00:16:57,929
I hope you enjoy it!

312
00:16:57,952 --> 00:17:00,354
I’m so excited!

313
00:17:00,378 --> 00:17:03,645
It’s been a while since I watched a new anime.

314
00:17:03,667 --> 00:17:06,201
I’m sure you’ll love it.

315
00:17:06,224 --> 00:17:07,424
Yeah.

316
00:17:07,447 --> 00:17:10,918
I’ll share my thoughts tomorrow!

317
00:17:10,942 --> 00:17:12,385
Yeah.

318
00:17:12,408 --> 00:17:14,808
See you tomorrow!

319
00:17:14,831 --> 00:17:17,831
Scene 6: The Joy of Shopping

320
00:17:17,831 --> 00:17:23,564
I went shopping at the new department store yesterday.

321
00:17:23,587 --> 00:17:25,681
Nice!

322
00:17:25,704 --> 00:17:28,471
What did you buy?

323
00:17:28,494 --> 00:17:33,661
I got new sneakers and a smartphone.

324
00:17:33,684 --> 00:17:36,622
You bought a lot!

325
00:17:36,645 --> 00:17:40,516
How are the new sneakers?

326
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:43,350
They’re so lightweight.

327
00:17:43,374 --> 00:17:48,040
And they’re easy to walk in—I really like them.

328
00:17:48,063 --> 00:17:51,230
That’s great!

329
00:17:51,253 --> 00:17:53,626
Were they cheap?

330
00:17:53,649 --> 00:17:57,386
Yeah, they were a great deal.

331
00:17:57,409 --> 00:17:59,650
Only five thousand yen!

332
00:17:59,673 --> 00:18:03,073
What a steal!

333
00:18:03,096 --> 00:18:06,696
How’s the new smartphone?

334
00:18:06,719 --> 00:18:11,553
Super convenient, but it was expensive.

335
00:18:11,576 --> 00:18:14,413
Is the screen big?

336
00:18:14,437 --> 00:18:21,105
Yes, the big screen makes videos so easy to watch.

337
00:18:21,128 --> 00:18:23,222
Nice!

338
00:18:23,245 --> 00:18:26,850
Did you see anything else?

339
00:18:26,874 --> 00:18:30,731
There was a really nice watch.

340
00:18:30,755 --> 00:18:33,890
Didn’t you buy it?

341
00:18:33,913 --> 00:18:41,124
No, the design was great, but it was a bit heavy, so I passed.

342
00:18:41,148 --> 00:18:42,926
I see.

343
00:18:42,949 --> 00:18:47,982
For something you use every day, lighter is better.

344
00:18:48,005 --> 00:18:50,839
Exactly.

345
00:18:50,862 --> 00:18:54,528
I also checked out some winter coats.

346
00:18:54,551 --> 00:18:57,797
How were they?

347
00:18:57,821 --> 00:19:00,787
It looked so cozy.

348
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:03,622
Did you buy it?

349
00:19:03,646 --> 00:19:09,450
No, I didn’t. The color wasn’t quite right.

350
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:13,728
Shopping can be tricky, but it’s so much fun!

351
00:19:13,752 --> 00:19:21,441
Yeah, between the sneakers and the smartphone, the sneakers were my best purchase.

352
00:19:21,464 --> 00:19:26,121
I’d love to check out that department store sometime.

353
00:19:26,145 --> 00:19:30,178
Want to go together next week?

354
00:19:30,201 --> 00:19:32,135
Nice!

355
00:19:32,158 --> 00:19:34,758
Let’s go together!

356
00:19:34,781 --> 00:19:37,781
Scene 7: Exploring Cafés and Restaurants with Friends

357
00:19:37,781 --> 00:19:42,381
I went out with friends last weekend.

358
00:19:42,404 --> 00:19:44,940
Where did you go?

359
00:19:44,963 --> 00:19:50,580
We hit up a new café and a restaurant near the station.

360
00:19:50,604 --> 00:19:52,570
That sounds great!

361
00:19:52,593 --> 00:19:56,327
How was the new café?

362
00:19:56,350 --> 00:19:59,350
It was such a peaceful spot.

363
00:19:59,373 --> 00:20:02,973
The coffee was amazing too.

364
00:20:02,996 --> 00:20:05,562
Was the place nice?

365
00:20:05,585 --> 00:20:10,152
Yeah, it was really stylish and clean.

366
00:20:10,175 --> 00:20:12,975
Was it crowded?

367
00:20:12,998 --> 00:20:17,815
Not really, it wasn’t too busy.

368
00:20:17,838 --> 00:20:20,838
We were able to just relax.

369
00:20:20,861 --> 00:20:23,676
That sounds like a perfect café.

370
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:26,833
How was the restaurant?

371
00:20:26,856 --> 00:20:30,856
The restaurant was lively and fun.

372
00:20:30,879 --> 00:20:33,547
How was the service?

373
00:20:33,571 --> 00:20:37,142
The service was excellent.

374
00:20:37,166 --> 00:20:40,699
Everyone was so friendly.

375
00:20:40,722 --> 00:20:43,455
Was the food good?

376
00:20:43,478 --> 00:20:47,212
Oh, it was delicious!

377
00:20:47,235 --> 00:20:51,468
Though it was a bit pricey.

378
00:20:51,491 --> 00:20:54,362
It’s definitely a place for special occasions.

379
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:57,189
Exactly.

380
00:20:57,213 --> 00:21:01,663
After that, we went to a famous department store.

381
00:21:01,686 --> 00:21:04,420
How was the department store?

382
00:21:04,443 --> 00:21:07,043
It was huge!

383
00:21:07,066 --> 00:21:13,000
And since it was packed, I got a little tired.

384
00:21:13,023 --> 00:21:17,877
Sunday department stores are always crowded, right?

385
00:21:17,901 --> 00:21:23,235
Yeah, so we ended the day at an old bookstore.

386
00:21:23,258 --> 00:21:26,191
How was the bookstore?

387
00:21:26,214 --> 00:21:31,381
It was a little dim, but they had so many interesting books.

388
00:21:31,404 --> 00:21:36,337
Out of the four places, which one did you like the most?

389
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:41,094
I loved the new café the most.

390
00:21:41,117 --> 00:21:43,208
I’d love to go back.

391
00:21:43,231 --> 00:21:47,442
Let me know the name of that place next time!

392
00:21:47,466 --> 00:21:50,466
Scene 8: Experiencing Seasonal Events in Japan

393
00:21:50,466 --> 00:21:55,099
I’ve been living in Japan for a year now.

394
00:21:55,122 --> 00:21:59,090
Wow, time flies!

395
00:21:59,114 --> 00:22:00,847
Yeah.

396
00:22:00,870 --> 00:22:06,471
I’ve experienced so many seasonal events this year.

397
00:22:06,494 --> 00:22:10,571
Which one left the biggest impression on you?

398
00:22:10,594 --> 00:22:14,885
The summer festival and fireworks display.

399
00:22:14,909 --> 00:22:17,676
How was the festival?

400
00:22:17,699 --> 00:22:20,432
It was so lively and exciting!

401
00:22:20,455 --> 00:22:23,489
It was really crowded.

402
00:22:23,511 --> 00:22:25,645
Did you have fun?

403
00:22:25,668 --> 00:22:29,634
Yes, I had a great time!

404
00:22:29,657 --> 00:22:31,860
I wore a yukata.

405
00:22:31,884 --> 00:22:33,684
Nice!

406
00:22:33,707 --> 00:22:36,920
How was the cherry blossom viewing in spring?

407
00:22:36,944 --> 00:22:41,150
The cherry blossoms in the park were absolutely stunning.

408
00:22:41,173 --> 00:22:44,573
Did you eat a bento with your friends?

409
00:22:44,596 --> 00:22:50,363
Yes, the bento we all shared was delicious!

410
00:22:50,386 --> 00:22:52,919
That’s great!

411
00:22:52,942 --> 00:22:56,315
Did you go anywhere in autumn?

412
00:22:56,338 --> 00:23:00,938
Yes, I went to the mountains to see the autumn leaves.

413
00:23:00,961 --> 00:23:03,929
How were the autumn leaves?

414
00:23:03,953 --> 00:23:07,807
The mountains were so beautiful, covered in red.

415
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:11,363
But it was a little chilly.

416
00:23:11,386 --> 00:23:15,753
The weather in the mountains can change so quickly in autumn.

417
00:23:15,776 --> 00:23:20,943
Yeah. And in winter, I went to a snow festival.

418
00:23:20,966 --> 00:23:23,574
How was the snow festival?

419
00:23:23,597 --> 00:23:26,764
It was freezing cold!

420
00:23:26,787 --> 00:23:31,798
But the white snow sculptures were breathtaking.

421
00:23:31,822 --> 00:23:36,662
Which of the four events moved you the most?

422
00:23:36,685 --> 00:23:41,419
I love summer festivals the most.

423
00:23:41,442 --> 00:23:45,114
I just love the lively atmosphere.

424
00:23:45,137 --> 00:23:49,616
Each season in Japan is so unique and fascinating.

425
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:53,574
Absolutely, I couldn’t agree more!

426
00:23:53,598 --> 00:23:56,598
Scene 9: The Joys and Challenges of Part-Time Jobs

427
00:23:56,598 --> 00:24:01,408
I recently started a new part-time job.

428
00:24:01,431 --> 00:24:03,564
That’s awesome!

429
00:24:03,587 --> 00:24:06,120
What kind of job is it?

430
00:24:06,143 --> 00:24:12,549
I work part-time at a convenience store and as a receptionist at a Japanese language school.

431
00:24:12,573 --> 00:24:15,606
You’re working two jobs?

432
00:24:15,629 --> 00:24:18,207
That sounds tough.

433
00:24:18,231 --> 00:24:21,475
Yeah, it’s a bit busy.

434
00:24:21,499 --> 00:24:24,432
How’s the convenience store job?

435
00:24:24,455 --> 00:24:29,389
There’s a lot to learn, so it’s challenging.

436
00:24:29,412 --> 00:24:31,465
Is it fun to watch?

437
00:24:31,488 --> 00:24:38,426
It is challenging, but it’s interesting because there are so many different products.

438
00:24:38,450 --> 00:24:41,650
How about the receptionist job at the language school?

439
00:24:41,673 --> 00:24:46,966
It’s really fun because I get to talk to people from all over the world.

440
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:49,867
That’s an important job.

441
00:24:49,890 --> 00:24:56,738
Yes, there are a lot of important documents, so I take my work seriously.

442
00:24:56,762 --> 00:25:01,095
Which job suits you better?

443
00:25:01,118 --> 00:25:05,403
I prefer the receptionist job.

444
00:25:05,426 --> 00:25:09,893
I love talking to people.

445
00:25:09,916 --> 00:25:13,723
You used to work in a restaurant kitchen, right?

446
00:25:13,747 --> 00:25:16,013
Exactly.

447
00:25:16,036 --> 00:25:18,970
How was that?

448
00:25:18,993 --> 00:25:23,726
It was tough because the kitchen was so hot.

449
00:25:23,749 --> 00:25:25,839
Was it busy?

450
00:25:25,863 --> 00:25:29,863
Yes, it was really busy.

451
00:25:29,886 --> 00:25:33,696
But I got better at cooking.

452
00:25:33,719 --> 00:25:36,786
That’s a great experience.

453
00:25:36,809 --> 00:25:44,296
Yeah, everyone at both of my current jobs is kind and friendly.

454
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:46,732
That’s a relief to hear.

455
00:25:46,755 --> 00:25:50,724
Take care and keep up the good work!

456
00:25:50,747 --> 00:25:52,514
Thanks so much!

457
00:25:52,537 --> 00:25:54,704
I will!

458
00:25:54,727 --> 00:25:57,727
Scene 10: Weekend Adventures / How I Spent My Weekends

459
00:25:57,727 --> 00:26:03,360
I did a lot of different things over the weekends this month.

460
00:26:03,383 --> 00:26:06,070
What did you do?

461
00:26:06,094 --> 00:26:12,160
On the first weekend, I relaxed at home and read a book.

462
00:26:12,183 --> 00:26:14,917
How was the reading?

463
00:26:14,940 --> 00:26:20,994
It was quiet at home, so I could really focus.

464
00:26:21,017 --> 00:26:24,229
Was the book interesting?

465
00:26:24,253 --> 00:26:28,858
No, not really.

466
00:26:28,882 --> 00:26:31,524
That’s too bad.

467
00:26:31,547 --> 00:26:36,080
What did you do the next weekend?

468
00:26:36,103 --> 00:26:39,237
I played tennis with a friend.

469
00:26:39,260 --> 00:26:41,543
Sports are great!

470
00:26:41,566 --> 00:26:43,771
How was it?

471
00:26:43,794 --> 00:26:47,054
I got really warmed up.

472
00:26:47,078 --> 00:26:52,444
I felt so energized, but I was tired the next day.

473
00:26:52,467 --> 00:26:56,301
Well, you don’t usually get much exercise, do you?

474
00:26:56,323 --> 00:26:59,523
Exactly.

475
00:26:59,546 --> 00:27:05,021
The weekend after that, I went to the movies.

476
00:27:05,045 --> 00:27:07,688
How was the movie?

477
00:27:07,712 --> 00:27:11,998
The sound was so loud!

478
00:27:12,021 --> 00:27:15,675
It was so intense—I was really moved.

479
00:27:15,698 --> 00:27:19,311
There’s nothing like watching a movie in the theater.

480
00:27:19,335 --> 00:27:22,968
Yeah, it was amazing.

481
00:27:22,991 --> 00:27:29,686
And on the last weekend, I went hiking in the mountains nearby.

482
00:27:29,710 --> 00:27:32,489
How was the hike?

483
00:27:32,512 --> 00:27:35,314
The weather was great, though.

484
00:27:35,338 --> 00:27:39,139
The air was so fresh.

485
00:27:39,162 --> 00:27:40,829
Was it far?

486
00:27:40,852 --> 00:27:45,260
Yeah, it was a bit of a trek.

487
00:27:45,283 --> 00:27:49,856
I walked a lot, so my legs were sore afterward.

488
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:54,647
Out of all four weekends, which did you enjoy the most?

489
00:27:54,670 --> 00:27:59,270
I loved hiking the most.

490
00:27:59,293 --> 00:28:02,893
There was so much nature around.

491
00:28:02,916 --> 00:28:05,916
What a wonderful month it’s been!

492
00:28:05,939 --> 00:28:10,272
Yes, it was a really fulfilling break.